          <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Create a conversion deletion request **This endpoint is currently in beta and not available to all apps.** [Learn more](/docs/key-concepts/using-beta-and-restricted-features/). Create a request to delete conversion data for a list of user emails and/or EPIKs, limited to the specified &#x60;ad_account_id&#x60;. After 72 hours the request is processed and submitted to our deletion process. Then the deletion process ensures deletion within a 30 days period, once the request is submitted to the deletion process it cannot be canceled.</stringProp>
        </HTTPSamplerProxy>
